<title>LITHUANIA: CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR MAY 6/7.</title>
<headline>CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR MAY 6/7.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania set</p>
<p>the following currency fixings for Wednesday, May 7 on</p>
<p>Tuesday. The litas is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of</p>
<p>four to one.</p>
<p>		   07.05.97	  06.05.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.4752	    6.4808</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.3138	    2.3166</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.5110	    4.5170</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.1788	    3.1587</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.5069	    0.5072</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7679	    0.7679</p>
<p>    EKK	  0.2892	    0.2895</p>
<p>    LAT	  6.8640	    6.8705</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6947	    0.6947</p>
<p>    PLN	  1.2634	    1.2646</p>
<p>--Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
